  "problem": "A processing tank initially holds $420\\,\\text{L}$ of liquid containing $10\\,\\text{kg}$ of dissolved preservative.\nA feed solution containing $0.05\\,\\text{kg/L}$ of the preservative is pumped into the tank at a rate of $18\\,\\text{L/min},$ while the completely mixed liquid is drained out at a rate of $12\\,\\text{L/min}.$\nFind, rounded to two decimal places, the amount of preservative in the tank $15$ minutes after pumping begins.",
